# dnf.list — Fedora / RHEL / CentOS / Rocky / Alma baseline.
# One package per line; blank lines and lines starting with # are skipped.
# setup.sh runs `sudo dnf install -y` on this list.
#
# Desktop additions live in dnf-desktop.list. Packages absent from
# Fedora's default repos (discord, veracrypt, ghostty, JetBrains Mono
# Nerd Font, lefthook) fall through to snap.list or a release-binary
# bootstrap in setup.sh. Discord and veracrypt also have RPM Fusion
# entries — setup.sh enables RPM Fusion before installing if needed.
#
# Source of truth for the dnf column of doc/packages-native.md. Keep
# the two in lockstep (CLAUDE.md §6).

# Shell + prompt
zsh
zsh-autosuggestions
zsh-syntax-highlighting
zsh-history-substring-search
starship
atuin

# File / search tools
eza
bat
fzf
ripgrep
fd-find
zoxide
tldr
jq

# Editor stack
vim
neovim
tmux

# Git + dev tooling
git
git-delta
gnupg
pinentry
ShellCheck

# Language toolchains
golang
rustup
nodejs
llvm
clang-tools-extra

# Networking / sysadmin
arp-scan
bandwhich
bind-utils
wget
curl

# Containers — left commented because Docker on Linux is per-user
# choice (rooted vs rootless / podman as drop-in). Uncomment what you
# want:
#
# (a) Rooted, Fedora-packaged (moby-engine = open-source build of
#     docker-engine; system daemon):
# moby-engine
# docker-compose-plugin
#
# (b) Rooted via Docker's official RPM repo
#     (https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/fedora/):
# docker-ce
# docker-ce-cli
# containerd.io
# docker-buildx-plugin
# docker-compose-plugin
#
# (c) Rootless via Docker's official RPM repo (pair with
#     `dockerd-rootless-setuptool.sh install`):
# docker-ce-cli
# docker-ce-rootless-extras
# docker-buildx-plugin
# docker-compose-plugin
# fuse-overlayfs
# shadow-utils
#
# (d) Podman (Fedora's default — daemonless, rootless by default):
# podman
# podman-compose

# VM / virtualization (comment out if you don't need libvirt/qemu)
libvirt
qemu-kvm

# Filesystem / misc
sqlite
zip
unzip
asciinema

# Fonts
fontawesome-fonts
jetbrains-mono-fonts
